# Copy to .env (gitignored). Credentials are only ever read by scripts/,
# never by the agent directly (.claude/settings.pipeline.json denies Read on .env).
#
# Per-site credentials are appended as <SITE>_USER / <SITE>_PASSWORD pairs
# when a job portal requires a login, e.g.:
# WELLFOUND_USER=you@example.com
# WELLFOUND_PASSWORD=...
